\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/plugins\\/unlimited-elements-for-elementor\\/images\\/gallery1.jpg\"},\"_id\":\"567e171\"}],\"multisource_instagram\":\"@gianlucavacchi\",\"multisource_instagram_num_items\":12,\"uc_items\":[{\"title\":\"Seguridad Perimetral Activa\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/pexels-brett-sayles-2881224-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":124,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_attributes_nosize\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/agency1.jpg\\\"\",\"image_attributes\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/agency1.jpg\\\"\",\"image_thumb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/agency1.jpg\",\"content\":\"<p><strong>Nginx Proxy Manager<\\/strong> centraliza el acceso mediante HTTPS y SSL nativos, aislando y protegiendo por completo la red interna.<\\/p>\",\"btn_text\":\"Saber m\\u00e1s\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"#\"},\"template\":\"\",\"template_templateid\":\"\",\"_generated_id\":\"tffoa\",\"item_repeater_class\":\"elementor-repeater-item-tffoa\",\"_id\":\"bdb5fd0\"},{\"title\":\"Persistencia Centralizada\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/pexels-cookiecutter-17489151-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":125,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_attributes_nosize\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/party-bg-1024x768.jpg\\\"\",\"image_attributes\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/party-bg-1024x768.jpg\\\"\",\"image_thumb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/party-bg-1024x768.jpg\",\"content\":\"<p>Motores de <strong>PostgreSQL, MongoDB y MySQL<\\/strong> estructurados en esquemas aislados para un rendimiento veloz y seguro.<\\/p>\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"#\"},\"template\":\"\",\"template_templateid\":\"\",\"_generated_id\":\"u1qcx\",\"item_repeater_class\":\"elementor-repeater-item-u1qcx\",\"_id\":\"e5f1a93\"},{\"title\":\"Orquestaci\\u00f3n y Resiliencia\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/pexels-brett-sayles-5050305-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":136,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_attributes_nosize\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/agency-1024x683.jpg\\\"\",\"image_attributes\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/agency-1024x683.jpg\\\"\",\"image_thumb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/agency-1024x683.jpg\",\"content\":\"<p>Control centralizado v\\u00eda <strong>Portainer con Vaultwarden<\\/strong> para llaves maestras y <strong>Duplicati<\\/strong> para respaldos externos automatizados.<\\/p>\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"#\"},\"template\":\"\",\"template_templateid\":\"\",\"_generated_id\":\"pbd5n\",\"item_repeater_class\":\"elementor-repeater-item-pbd5n\",\"_id\":\"0e914cc\"},{\"title\":\"Inteligencia de Rendimiento\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/pexels-sejio402-6466141-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":137,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_attributes_nosize\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/img3.jpg\\\"\",\"image_attributes\":\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/img3.jpg\\\"\",\"image_thumb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.nodo.ve\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/ac_assets\\/uc_content_carousel\\/img3.jpg\",\"content\":\"<p>Monitoreo profundo en tiempo real con <strong>Zabbix,\\u00a0 Grafana y Loki<\\/strong> para predecir y resolver incidentes antes de que ocurran.<\\/p>\",\"link